{"id":"d49307c3-3726-4fe3-aea3-eb0ca1bc3c1d","title":"Isotopes 3","slug":"isotopes-3","collectionSlug":"isotopes","collectionName":"Isotopes","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic, motion-based shader effect featuring a dark navy background (#050029) with vibrant green and cyan tones dominating the composition. The primary visual element consists of radially-arranged circular particles (red #fc0808 base color) that are being tracked and manipulated by mouse movement with momentum-based smoothing. These particles create a trailing effect with a cyan tint (#33aaff) that follows the cursor position with drift values controlled by mouse input on both X and Y axes. The TimeTrail component generates motion blur and ghosting effects, creating streaking patterns that fade over time. A GradientMap overlay applies a color remapping using a custom palette transitioning from yellow-brown (#b6b127) through dark green (#1d5624) to bright cyan (#0deb8e), creating an organic, nature-inspired color shift across the entire composition. The LensDistortion effect adds significant visual complexity with a swirl distortion (0.35 intensity) centered slightly right of frame center, creating a subtle vortex-like warping effect. Chromatic aberration (dispersion 1.0) introduces color fringing, particularly visible on the edges of the distorted areas. The overall effect is highly interactive and responsive, with particles appearing to flow and swirl around the cursor position, creating a fluid, organic appearance reminiscent of flowing water or energy fields. The grain overlay (0.04) and noise elements add subtle texture and visual noise, while the perspective distortion (0.1) creates depth. The composition has a soft, blurred quality in the background with sharper definition in the interactive particle region.","colors":["#050029","#33aaff","#fc0808","#0deb8e","#1d5624"],"labels":["organic","glowing","vibrant","dramatic"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/d49307c3-3726-4